# UFunPlayer language pack — English
# This file is the master template every other langs\*.lang file is
# translated from. It mirrors InitDefaultStrings() in UFunPlayer.cpp exactly.
#
# Format: KEY=value  (UTF-8, '#' comments, blank lines ignored)
# Escapes recognized in values: \n = newline, \t = tab, \\ = literal backslash
# Keep %s / %d placeholders in the SAME COUNT AND ORDER as this file when
# translating — they are filled in positionally by the program.

